meshcore-tdoa-gateway-installers
================================

This repository is the public distribution layer (apt repo, install
script, firmware bundle, runtime patches) for the MeshCore TDOA gateway
portal. The portal source code lives in a separate private repository.

Third-party material redistributed here
----------------------------------------

Upstream MeshCore firmware
  Source:    https://github.com/meshcore-dev/MeshCore
  License:   MIT (see LICENSE)
  Copyright: ripplebiz and MeshCore contributors

  We redistribute pre-compiled `.bin` / `.uf2` artifacts built from
  upstream releases (companion_radio_*, repeater, room_server variants
  for Heltec V4, LilyGo T-Echo, RAK4631) under `/firmware/<hw>/upstream/`.
  These are byte-for-byte the official upstream release artifacts.

TDOA fork firmware
  Source:    https://github.com/D-creek/MeshCore
  License:   MIT (inherits upstream)
  Copyright: ripplebiz + MeshCore contributors + D-creek (TDOA additions)

  We redistribute pre-compiled TDOA-RX variants from D-creek's CI runs
  under `/firmware/<hw>/<role>.<ext>` (e.g. tdoa-rx.bin, repeater-tdoa-
  rx.bin). TDOA additions are layered on top of upstream MeshCore source
  with timestamp + GPS telemetry instrumentation.

Original work in this distribution
-----------------------------------

Portal binary  (`meshcore-tdoa-gateway-portal_*.deb`)
  Pure-Python service: web UI + per-USB device config + MQTT broker
  fan-out + auto-update timer. Original work under MIT (see LICENSE).

Install script + runtime patches (`install.sh`, `patches/*`)
  Original work under MIT (see LICENSE).
